:''Not to be confused with [[E-795]].''
'''Ancient Egg: N111''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after completing 55 [[Behemoth Culling]] stages for the first time. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]].

